    {
      "type": "len_string",
      "start": 631,
      "end": 2169,
      "length": 1536,
      "text": "\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0007\u0000\u0000\u0000\b\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\r\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000e\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\r\u0000\u0000\u0000\f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0010\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u000f\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0015\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0014\u0000\u0000\u0000\u00f6\u00ff\u00e6\u0000R\u0001The Bulldog was an attempt to make a big brother to the very sucessful Maddog OmniMech, known in the Inner Sphere as the Hagateka, or Vulture.   Though the design was a marginal success, updating the chassis to 75 tons, some critics feel this design is merely a stopgap in attempt to fill holes in the still recovering Clan Forces.   \r\n\r\nJ\u0004The Prime Model of the Bulldog is one of hard hitting power.  It is designed, like it's predecessor, to offer long range fire support, and the over all look is very similar to the Original Maddog.  Updating the systems with Artemis IV fire controls allowed this mech more accuracy, which in term led to a smaller payload of ammo.\r\n\r\nThe the designers got interesting...\r\n\r\nThe Arms house a wide array of laser weapondry, perhaps a touch too jack-of-all-trades.  The first and most prominent weapons are the Extended Range Large Lasers in each arm, paired with an ER Medium Laser as well, a nod to the tried and true original.  After that, mounted right above them, in much smaller housings, are a set are ER Small and ER Micro Lasers.   Several Inner Sphere Tacticians are still trying to puzzle the purpose of so many laser weapons, while the design as it is would allow no more than 15 heat sinks, hardly considered adequate for dispersing the great amounts of heat produced by the beam weapons.  The have figured that the ER Micro Lasers were added"
    },
    {
      "type": "ascii",
      "start": 2169,
      "end": 2216,
      "text": " to fill space, as a kind of Close up weapon.  "
